  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;The proposed development would appear obtrusive and be incompatible with the character of the host property and the terrace of which it forms part also introduce a roof extension to a terrace with an unbroken roofline, thereby disrupting the existing streetscape. For these reasons, the proposal fails to respect the character and appearance of the area and is contrary to Policy D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach) of the London Plan (2021) and Policy LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033.&lt;/p&gt;"
